Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:07:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Sweet Honey: choose the Pokemon before flipping (#434)

Playing Sweet Honey now queues the choice among your damaged Pokemon (the
targets Potion offers; can_play_potion still decides playability) before any
coin is flipped. The new FlipUntilTailsThenHeal action then flips until tails
(at most 8 heads) and heals 20 per heads on the chosen Pokemon.

Tests: tests/trainers/c1_sweet_honey_test.rs (the heal test in the new order;
the pending choices are only the damaged Pokemon, identical across seeds,
nothing healed yet; the heal lands on the chosen Benched Pokemon only).

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
